Woke up feeling grateful and inspired by the people I’ve connected with here. It still amazes me how much value there is on this platform, and I wanted to give a few people their flowers.

Two recent connections deserve a shout-out. Both have exceptional market intuition and an eye for opportunities in SMID:

@ThematicTrader is wicked smart. He combines the ability to go deep on his names with a real understanding of how to make money. I’ve been impressed by his results, but just as much by how thoughtfully he thinks about where things are heading. Really excited to watch his career unfold.

@mathlonning has a great instinct for finding value in small caps, with the track record to back it up. What stands out is how quickly he gets to the heart of an opportunity and keeps things simple without losing the nuance. That’s a rare skill.

I also want to shout out @ethanrkho for pushing conversations in finance forward and inspiring me to embrace the opportunities that come with being a retail investor. I’m a big believer in bringing more perspectives into the financial world, and his work is a great example of why that matters. The quality is next level.

There are plenty of others I’ve connected with who have taught me a lot about markets and business, and whom I’ve come to appreciate on a personal level too:

@hiteshkar
@drrichjlaw
@OncNTechStuff
@jiahanjimliu
@MarkosAAIG
@Mark_AAIG
@kevin__mak (one of the GOATs)
@Biotech2k1
@FundamentEdge
@nathanbenaich
@HotAisle
@convequity

I’m excited about the future and the opportunities in the market right now. If you’re digging into optics, power, biotech, labor shortages, prefab, enterprise SaaS, cybersecurity, or compute, I’d love to chat. Bonus points for SMID companies.

A lot to learn, a lot to be excited about, and a lot of good people to learn alongside.

